  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Ford Motor has $619M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Ford Motor recorded 16,399 awards in the current fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $37.7K. Obligations are up 30.5% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations have varied in recent years: FY21 $503M, FY22 $688M, FY23 $307M, FY24 $580M, FY25 $474M, and FY26 $619M. The General Services Administration is the leading buyer for Ford Motor in FY2026 to date. Automobile Manufacturing is the largest NAICS market for Ford Motor in FY2026 to date. All figures are contract obligations except award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Current-year totals are partial fiscal year to date.",
