        "heading": "What is Ford Motor’s federal contracting position in FY2026 to date?",
        "body": "Ford Motor has $619M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Ford Motor recorded 16,399 awards with an average award size of $37.7K, and obligations are up 30.5% year over year. Ford Motor’s fiscal-year obligations show FY21 $503M, FY22 $688M, FY23 $307M, FY24 $580M, and FY25 $474M. The General Services Administration is the principal buyer in FY2026 to date."
      },
